+++ b/docs/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -15,6 +15,14 @@ and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+- **Retire diagnostics before replacing project services.** Previously accepted diagnostic sends finish queuing before project retirement, preventing old service publications from crossing the replacement boundary. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
+
+- **Recognize transitive Laravel installations.** Framework discovery reads Composer installed metadata and resolves framework configuration from its declared install path, including custom vendor locations. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
+
+- **Check attribute closure availability.** Static noncapturing attribute-argument closures require PHP 8.5; unsupported closure forms receive their own diagnostics while legal attribute classes remain available. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
+
+- **Refresh saved PHP target profiles.** Project PHP version and extension changes rebuild built-ins and diagnostics while preserving unsaved files. Unrelated projects retain their last valid configuration when saved settings are malformed. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
+
 - **Use selected PHP for external formatting.** Editor formatting with PHP-script Pint, php-cs-fixer and phpcbf, including Pint Blade, uses the selected local interpreter. Invalid selections refuse PHP execution; standalone CLI formatting keeps its inherited interpreter. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
 
 - **Refresh dependencies when installed metadata changes.** Composer dependency completion and navigation refresh after the project's installed metadata is created, changed or removed, including configured vendor directories. Unsaved project files are retained. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
